==French==

===Etymology===
{{univerbation|fr|en|fin}}. Literally 'in the end'.

===Pronunciation===
* {{fr-IPA}}
* {{audio|fr|Fr-enfin.ogg|audio}}

===Adverb===
{{fr-adv}}

# [[finally]]; [[in the end]]
# [[at last]], [[finally]]
# [[in fact]]; [[indeed]]
# {{ng|Introduces a contradiction, objection, limitation or correction of what has just been stated.}}
#: {{parasyn|fr|du moins<t:at least>|néanmoins|plutôt<t:rather>|toutefois}}
#* '''2021''', Angèle, ''Démons''
#*: {{quote|fr|Jusqu'ici tout va bien, enfin ça allait.|'Til now, everything's going fine — at least, it was.}}
#: {{ux|fr|Il sait ce qu'il doit faire, '''enfin''' c'est ce que j'espère.|He knows what he has to do, '''or''' so I hope.}}

===Interjection===
{{fr-intj}}

# [[at last]], [[finally]], [[about time]]!
#: {{syn|fr|[[pas]] [[trop]] [[tôt]] !}}

